      "side": 1,
      "message": "We still can see the PPVAR_SYS dip if dut turn on with the shipping battery. I think the problem is the shipping battery will report the current soc to ec even if the discharging FET of the battery has not turned on yet. So that cause the chipset task skip delay and turn on 5V with not enough power. In this case, I think it is necessary to check disconnect state and add delay if need before we turn on 5V.",
